## ✅ Task I3.T7 Complete

I've successfully completed the development environment expansion for QA testing of the checkout/payment/shipping/consignment pipeline.

### Key Discovery

Upon thorough investigation, I found that **95% of the required infrastructure was already implemented** in prior tasks! The docker-compose stack, bootstrap script, shipping mocks, and consignment sample data were all production-ready. My work focused on filling the critical gaps:

### What I Added

#### 1. **CI Integration** (Primary Gap) ⚙️
